<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <!-- Question 2: Embed a Google Map using an iframe -->
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Q2 - Google Map Embed</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Map of My City - Mathura, Uttar Pradesh</h1>

    <!-- The loading="lazy" attribute tells the browser to delay loading this
         iframe's content until it is about to come into the visible viewport.
         This improves initial page load speed, since the map (a heavy resource)
         is not fetched until the user actually scrolls near it. -->
    <iframe
        title="Map showing Mathura, Uttar Pradesh"
        width="600"
        height="450"
        loading="lazy"
        src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Mathura,Uttar+Pradesh,India&output=embed">
    </iframe>

</body>
</html>
